# D4(a): the layer-17 quartet's attention under D versus its Neutral-Clause Twin, on the B1 held-out ids.
# Question: does the query-side signal of F-rte-006 change which positions the quartet attends to? B1 found that the
# pressure enters L17H24 to L17H27 at the final-token query (query restoration moves 0.32 on FAR and 0.43 on SER, key
# restoration about zero). If the query changes, the Readout-query attention mass per Segment of the four heads
# should move between D and the twin; this job measures that mass, it does not decide anything (spec.md D4 rules:
# "(a) and (b) report their numbers"). Direction deception-divergence, rider D4(a) (START.md section 2 D4(a)).
# Each line composes the grid C_t exactly as instructed-route jobs/B1-<task>.batch does (its --circuit, --expr Ct=...,
# --compose-granularity leaf, --reference and --task-from flags, copied verbatim, themselves copied from
# mechanism-analysis 05-p3-<task>.batch), so the cell holds C_t (far 72, ser 78 Components) and the quartet is in it;
# attention_patterns profiles every C_t head (62 on far) at no extra cost per layer, and the reading is the quartet's
# four rows of attention/patterns.json.
# Conditions: neutral_twin only, which brings its own left term pressure_neutral_twin_paired (D on the same ids, read
# in the same loader order) and the B2 signature (per-head paired clause-mass drop with its SE). Query position: the
# Readout (default). Split: designation polarity (default), with the unsplit "all" level.
# Rows: --attention-instances causal_sample makes both twin sides read the causal sample, which --include-ids and
# --n-causal 100 fix to the 100 ids of phase1/groups/<task>_heldout_D_sample.json (the B1 held-out ids). Without the
# flag the condition reads the whole 1,000-row test split (the default, unchanged).
# Run from the repo root:  python analyze_components.py batch docs/research/deception-divergence/jobs/D4a.batch --timings outputs/_analyses/deception-divergence/d4a/timings/d4a.json
# Login check:            python analyze_components.py batch docs/research/deception-divergence/jobs/D4a.batch --dry-run

# far: C_t on far_v2 D and its Neutral-Clause Twin, the 100 held-out ids
--circuit Df=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_far_v2_coarse/nls0.3_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-140717 --circuit Hf=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_far_v2_coarse/nls0.3_honest_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-140323 --circuit Ds=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_sdr_v2_coarse/nls0.3_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-140323 --circuit Hs=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_sdr_v2_coarse/nls0.3_honest_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-140323 --circuit De=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_ser_v2_coarse/nls0.3_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-173101 --circuit He=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_ser_v2_coarse/nls0.3_honest_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-140323 --circuit m=outputs/_launch_mechanism_v2/evals/operands/allmlp_nomb_v2 --circuit X=outputs/_launch_mechanism_analysis/operands/skct_far --expr 'Ct=(((Df&Ds&De)|(Df-Ds-De)|((Df-Hf)-(Df&Ds&De)))-m)|X' --compose-granularity leaf --reference far_D=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_far_v2_coarse/nls0.3_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-140717 --reference far_H=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_far_v2_coarse/nls0.3_honest_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-140323 --reference sdr_D=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_sdr_v2_coarse/nls0.3_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-140323 --reference sdr_H=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_sdr_v2_coarse/nls0.3_honest_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-140323 --reference ser_D=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_ser_v2_coarse/nls0.3_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-173101 --reference ser_H=outputs/llama-8b-instruct_ser_v2_coarse/nls0.3_honest_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-140323 --reference x_far=outputs/_launch_mechanism_analysis/operands/skct_far --task-from outputs/llama-8b-instruct_far_v2_coarse/nls0.3_noedge_noan_nomh_nomo_nomb_261021-140717 --include-ids docs/research/mechanism-analysis/phase1/groups/far_heldout_D_sample.json --n-causal 100 --analyses attention_patterns --attention-conditions neutral_twin --attention-instances causal_sample --output-dir outputs/_analyses/deception-divergence/d4a/far

